        "id": 5631
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-07-08T15:03:42Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "In that case, we\u0027d need to draw it twice (once with normal fill, and again with inverse)? And I suspect that would do some strange stuff along the AA edges, where we\u0027d be applying both blend modes cumulatively?",
      "parentUuid": "ad55b3e1_63897c51",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 116,
        "startChar": 16,
